                 together since the last universe peace meeting... Most
                 of them look like tho type you wouldn't want to double
                 cross... There is a quiet man with a huge scar on his
                 cheek sitting in a dark corner.

                  `9(`!T`9)alk To Man With Scar        `9(`!Q`9)uit To Ship 




